{"ts": "2026-09-27T07:25:43Z", "id": "polymarket:1027446@2026-09-27T07:25:43Z", "event": "polymarket:1027446", "keys": ["polymarket:4581768", "polymarket:4581765"], "mids": {"polymarket:4581768": 0.515, "polymarket:4581765": 0.255}, "raw_facts": [{"kind": "schedule", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "Sports Mole", "url": "https://www.sportsmole.co.uk/football/belgium/uefa-nations-league/preview/belgium-vs-france-prediction-team-news-lineups_605847.html", "fact": "Belgium host France on Monday, 28 September 2026 at 20:45 local time (18:45 UTC) at the King Baudouin Stadium in Brussels. It is matchday 2 of League A Group 1 in the 2026/27 UEFA Nations League."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-25", "source": "beIN SPORTS", "url": "https://www.beinsports.com/en-mena/football/uefa-nations-league/articles-video/mbappe-scores-but-suffers-knee-injury-as-zidane-gets-debut-france-win-2026-09-25", "fact": "France won 1-0 away to Turkey in their Nations League opener, Zinedine Zidane's first game as France coach. Kylian Mbapp\u00e9 scored the winner in the 55th minute, set up by Michael Olise, but hurt his left knee moments later."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "ESPN", "url": "https://www.espn.com/soccer/story/_/id/50029181/mbappe-exits-knee-injury-scoring-france-zidane-debut", "fact": "Mbapp\u00e9 is leaving the France camp and will miss the rest of the international window, including the Belgium match. Real Madrid diagnosed an overstretching of the posterior capsule of his left knee. Zidane said: 'he is going to have to go home. We don't want to take any risks.'"}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "Sports Mole", "url": "https://www.sportsmole.co.uk/football/belgium/uefa-nations-league/preview/belgium-vs-france-prediction-team-news-lineups_605847.html", "fact": "Belgium won their opener 2-0 against Italy, with goals from Mika Godts and Dodi Lukebakio. It was Belgium's first clean sheet in five matches."}, {"kind": "status_now", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "Yahoo Sports", "url": "https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/preview-belgium-vs-france-team-185000175.html", "fact": "After matchday 1, Belgium and France both have 3 points. Belgium are 1st in the group and France 2nd."}, {"kind": "base_rate", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "Sports Mole", "url": "https://www.sportsmole.co.uk/football/belgium/uefa-nations-league/preview/belgium-vs-france-prediction-team-news-lineups_605847.html", "fact": "Belgium have lost each of their last five meetings with France, a run going back to June 2015."}, {"kind": "base_rate", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "Sports Mole", "url": "https://www.sportsmole.co.uk/football/belgium/uefa-nations-league/preview/belgium-vs-france-prediction-team-news-lineups_605847.html", "fact": "Belgium are unbeaten in 9 home games against all opponents since November 2024 (6 wins, 3 draws)."}, {"kind": "base_rate", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "Sports Mole", "url": "https://www.sportsmole.co.uk/football/belgium/uefa-nations-league/preview/belgium-vs-france-prediction-team-news-lineups_605847.html", "fact": "France have won 8 and drawn 1 of their last 9 away matches."}, {"kind": "base_rate", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "11v11", "url": "https://www.11v11.com/teams/belgium/tab/opposingTeams/opposition/France/", "fact": "The all-time record, from Belgium's side, is 30 wins, 19 draws and 25 losses against France, with 160 goals scored and 128 conceded. In the last 6 meetings France won 5 and Belgium 1, with no draws."}, {"kind": "base_rate", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "11v11", "url": "https://www.11v11.com/teams/belgium/tab/opposingTeams/opposition/France/", "fact": "Recent meetings include France 2-0 Belgium in the Nations League on 2024-09-09. The most recent meeting was a 3-2 France win over Belgium."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "Sports Mole", "url": "https://www.sportsmole.co.uk/football/belgium/uefa-nations-league/preview/belgium-vs-france-prediction-team-news-lineups_605847.html", "fact": "Belgium are without Leandro Trossard (heel injury). Apart from Mbapp\u00e9, France have no reported absentees."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "Yahoo Sports", "url": "https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/preview-belgium-vs-france-team-185000175.html", "fact": "Both teams have new coaches. Mark van Bommel took over Belgium on 15 August, replacing Rudi Garcia, who had taken Belgium to the 2026 World Cup quarter-finals. Zidane replaced Didier Deschamps as France coach after 14 years, and the Belgium match is his second game in charge."}, {"kind": "rules", "date": "2026-09-27", "source": "Question resolution rules", "url": "https://www.uefa.com/uefanationsleague/news/02a2-1fea5720f002-0f82761894aa-1000--2026-27-uefa-nations-league-games-to-look-out-for/", "fact": "Only the result after 90 minutes plus stoppage time counts. A draw resolves both the France and Belgium questions as 'No'."}], "source_urls": ["https://dossiers.dhnet.be/ligue-des-nations/", "https://en.fifaranking.net/nations/bel/results/head-to-head/index.php?team=fra", "https://en.fifaranking.net/nations/fra/results/head-to-head/index.php?team=bel", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026%E2%80%9327_in_Turkish_football", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Men%27s_FIH_Hockey_World_Cup", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Miss_France_2027", "https://fbref.com/en/stathead/matchup/teams/b1b36dcd/361422b9/France-vs-Belgium-History", "https://footystats.org/international/belgium-national-team-vs-france-national-team-h2h-stats", "https://globalsportsarchive.com/en/soccer/match/2026-09-28/belgium-vs-france/4095487", "https://gulfnews.com/sport/football/kylian-mbappe-left-out-of-france-squad-for-nations-league-games-1.104285491", "https://khelnow.com/football/world-football-france-vs-belgium-head-to-head-record-euro-202406", "https://m.aiscore.com/head-to-head/basketball/belgium-vs-france", "https://m.aiscore.com/head-to-head/soccer-belgium-vs-france", "https://merkur.com/en/sportsbetting/news/uefa-nations-league-matchday-predictions-for-2026-27-%E2%80%93-matchdays-1-and-2.html", "https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/preview-belgium-vs-france-team-185000175.html", "https://tips.gg/article/belgium-vs-france-predicted-lineups-team-news-2026/", "https://ua.news/en/sport/zidan-debiutuvav-peremogoiu-mbappe-travmuvavsia-the-national", "https://www.11v11.com/teams/belgium/tab/opposingTeams/opposition/France/", "https://www.beinsports.com/en-mena/football/uefa-nations-league/articles-video/mbappe-scores-but-suffers-knee-injury-as-zidane-gets-debut-france-win-2026-09-25", "https://www.cbssports.com/soccer/news/injured-kylian-mbappe-out-for-france-vs-portugal-in-nations-league", "https://www.espn.com/soccer/match/_/gameId/401861081/france-belgium", "https://www.espn.com/soccer/story/_/id/50029181/mbappe-exits-knee-injury-scoring-france-zidane-debut", "https://www.fotmob.com/matches/france-vs-belgium/1uv3r2", "https://www.fotmob.com/teams/6723/overview/france", "https://www.foxsports.com/soccer/nations-league-belgium-vs-france-sep-28-2026-game-boxscore-688973", "https://www.freetips.com/football/belgium-vs-france-tips-20260926-0018/", "https://www.goal.com/en/news/lucky-escape-for-kylian-mbappe-real-madrid-announce-diagnosis-on-the-superstar-s-injury/blt5663c54b882afb8e", "https://www.goal.com/en/news/tendon-injury-real-star-kylian-mbappe-forced-off-injured-after-scoring-for-france/blt52b1f57f12cf47e2", "https://www.mightytips.com/football-predictions/belgium-vs-france-prediction-28-09-2026/", "https://www.nbcsports.com/soccer/news/kylian-mbappe-injury-news-latest-update-on-france-real-madrid-superstar", "https://www.pressreader.com/usa/the-guardian-usa/20220611/282376928233046", "https://www.sportskeeda.com/football/belgium-vs-france-prediction-betting-tips-september-28th-2026", "https://www.sportsmole.co.uk/football/belgium/uefa-nations-league/preview/belgium-vs-france-prediction-team-news-lineups_605847.html", "https://www.stubhub.com/belgium-national-football-team-brussels-tickets-9-28-2026/event/161441318/", "https://www.thenationalnews.com/sport/2026/09/26/mbappe-injury-blow-for-zidane-mancinis-nightmare-return-and-isak-on-target-in-nations-league/", "https://www.thescore.com/natleaguea/event/96872", "https://www.thesoccerworldcups.com/head_to_head/france_vs_belgium.php", "https://www.uefa.com/uefanationsleague/news/02a2-1fea5720f002-0f82761894aa-1000--2026-27-uefa-nations-league-games-to-look-out-for/"], "meta": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "api_equivalent_usd": 0.24978, "searches": 4, "fetches": 2, "turns": 7, "latency_ms": 59144, "billing": "claude_plan"}}
{"ts": "2026-09-27T07:25:43Z", "id": "polymarket:45915@2026-09-27T07:25:43Z", "event": "polymarket:45915", "keys": ["polymarket:601819", "polymarket:601826"], "mids": {"polymarket:601819": 0.435, "polymarket:601826": 0.572}, "raw_facts": [{"kind": "status_now", "date": "2026-09-23", "source": "Reuters via US News (AtlasIntel/Bloomberg poll)", "url": "https://www.usnews.com/news/world/articles/2026-09-23/brazils-lula-flavio-bolsonaro-remain-tied-in-runoff-scenario-atlas-poll-shows", "fact": "AtlasIntel/Bloomberg surveyed 5,015 people from Sept 17\u201322 (margin \u00b11 pt). Runoff: Lula 47.7%, Fl\u00e1vio Bolsonaro 47.4%. First round: Lula 45.8%, Fl\u00e1vio 43.4%, Renan Santos 4.5%, Augusto Cury 2.1%, Ronaldo Caiado 1.3%."}, {"kind": "status_now", "date": "2026-09-25", "source": "Al Jazeera (Datafolha poll)", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/25/brazils-lula-and-flavio-bolsonaro-still-essentially-tied-in-new-poll", "fact": "Datafolha poll from Sept 22\u201323: runoff Lula 47%, Fl\u00e1vio Bolsonaro 45%, within the \u00b12 pt margin. First round: Lula 40%, Fl\u00e1vio 36%, Cury 5%, Caiado 4%, Santos 3%. A BTG Pactual/Nexus poll had the runoff at Lula 46%, Fl\u00e1vio 45%."}, {"kind": "status_now", "date": "2026-09-21", "source": "Rio Times / Reuters (Quaest poll)", "url": "https://www.riotimesonline.com/brazil-election-quaest-poll-flavio-42-lula-41-runoff-september-2026/", "fact": "Quaest poll released Sept 21: runoff Fl\u00e1vio Bolsonaro 42%, Lula 41%, inside the 2-pt margin of error. The same series had it at 42\u201340 a week earlier."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-07", "source": "Reuters via US News (Quaest/Globo poll)", "url": "https://www.usnews.com/news/world/articles/2026-09-07/lula-flavio-bolsonaro-tied-in-brazils-election-runoff-quaest-poll-shows", "fact": "Quaest/Globo poll published Sept 7 had Lula and Fl\u00e1vio Bolsonaro tied at 41% each in a runoff scenario."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-03", "source": "Gazeta do Povo (Datafolha poll)", "url": "https://www.gazetadopovo.com.br/eleicoes/2026/pesquisa-eleitoral-2026/datafolha-presidente-setembro-2026/", "fact": "Datafolha poll of 2,002 respondents, Sept 1\u20133: first round Lula 38%, Fl\u00e1vio 32%. Runoff Lula 46%, Fl\u00e1vio 44%. So between early and late September, Datafolha's first-round numbers went from 38\u201332 to 40\u201336, and the runoff from 46\u201344 to 47\u201345."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-08-15", "source": "Al Jazeera (Quaest poll)", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/8/15/lula-holds-slim-lead-over-flavio-bolsonaro-ahead-of-brazil-election", "fact": "Quaest poll from Aug 10\u201313 (2,004 people, commissioned by Globo): runoff Lula 43%, Fl\u00e1vio Bolsonaro 40%. By Sept 21, Quaest showed Fl\u00e1vio ahead 42\u201341."}, {"kind": "schedule", "date": "2026-09-27", "source": "Wikipedia \u2013 2026 Brazilian general election", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Brazilian_general_election", "fact": "First round is Oct 4, 2026. If no candidate gets more than 50% of valid votes, the top two go to a runoff on Oct 25, 2026. The registered candidates include Lula (PT, running mate Alckmin), Fl\u00e1vio Bolsonaro (PL), Caiado (PSD), Zema (NOVO), Cury (Avante), Renan Santos (Miss\u00e3o) and five minor-party candidates."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-15", "source": "Wikipedia \u2013 2026 Brazilian general election", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Brazilian_general_election", "fact": "From Sept 1\u201315, tensions grew around Supreme Court Justice Alexandre de Moraes after messages suggested improper closeness to banker Daniel Vorcaro. The Banco Master scandal and the INSS fraud scheme have dominated campaign coverage, touching people across party lines."}, {"kind": "rules", "date": "2026-09-23", "source": "Reuters via US News", "url": "https://www.usnews.com/news/world/articles/2026-09-23/brazils-lula-flavio-bolsonaro-remain-tied-in-runoff-scenario-atlas-poll-shows", "fact": "A first-round win requires more than 50% of valid votes; blank and null votes are excluded. Otherwise the top two meet in the Oct 25 runoff, and the question counts the runoff result."}, {"kind": "base_rate", "date": "2022-10-30", "source": "Wikipedia \u2013 Brazilian presidential elections", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2022_Brazilian_general_election", "fact": "Since re-election was allowed in 1997, 3 of 4 sitting presidents who ran again won: Cardoso in 1998, Lula in 2006 and Rousseff in 2014. Jair Bolsonaro lost to Lula in 2022, 50.9% to 49.1% in the runoff."}, {"kind": "base_rate", "date": "2022-10-02", "source": "Wikipedia \u2013 Opinion polling for the 2022 Brazilian presidential election", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opinion_polling_for_the_2022_Brazilian_presidential_election", "fact": "In the 2022 first round, final polls understated Jair Bolsonaro. Datafolha's last valid-vote poll had about Lula 50% vs Bolsonaro 36%; the actual result was Lula 48.4% vs Bolsonaro 43.2%."}, {"kind": "status_now", "date": "2026-09-19", "source": "JOTA (Palver poll)", "url": "https://www.jota.info/eleicoes/eleicoes-2026/lula-lidera-primeiro-turno-mas-empata-com-flavio-bolsonaro-no-segundo-aponta-palver", "fact": "A Palver poll had Lula leading the first round and tied with Fl\u00e1vio in the runoff. Both have high rejection rates: 52% for Lula and 51% for Fl\u00e1vio."}], "source_urls": ["https://amp.cbc.ca/lite/story/1.6634169", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Brazilian_general_election", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Rio_de_Janeiro_general_election", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opinion_polling_for_the_2022_Brazilian_presidential_election", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opinion_polling_for_the_2026_Brazilian_presidential_election", "https://euronews.com/2022/10/29/brazil-election-bolsonaro-and-lula-clash-in-last-tv-debate-before-sundays-vote", "https://globalnews.ca/news/9236818/bolsonaro-lula-presidential-election-brazil-polls", "https://iecofin.substack.com/p/lula-vs-tarcisio-em-2026", "https://kelo.com/2026/09/17/brazils-flavio-bolsonaro-lula-tied-in-runoff-scenario-atlas-poll-shows/", "https://news.yahoo.com/lula-widens-lead-over-bolsonaro-214402349.html", "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pesquisas_de_opini%C3%A3o_para_a_elei%C3%A7%C3%A3o_presidencial_no_Brasil_em_2026", "https://tagteam.harvard.edu/hub_feeds/3884/feed_items/17173505/content", "https://tagteam.harvard.edu/hub_feeds/3884/feed_items/17175199", "https://tagteam.harvard.edu/hub_feeds/3884/feed_items/17183858/content", "https://wsau.com/2026/09/17/brazils-flavio-bolsonaro-lula-tied-in-runoff-scenario-atlas-poll-shows/", "https://www.933thedrive.com/2026/09/17/brazils-flavio-bolsonaro-lula-tied-in-runoff-scenario-atlas-poll-shows/", "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2022/10/29/bolsonaro-and-lula-trade-blows-in-final-brazil-election-debate", "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2025/12/6/flavio-bolsonaro-enters-brazils-2026-presidential-race-with-fathers-nod", "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/8/15/lula-holds-slim-lead-over-flavio-bolsonaro-ahead-of-brazil-election", "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/25/brazils-lula-and-flavio-bolsonaro-still-essentially-tied-in-new-poll", "https://www.aol.com/articles/brazils-lula-flavio-bolsonaro-technical-113849098.html", "https://www.aol.com/articles/flavio-bolsonaro-draws-even-lula-161733328.html", "https://www.as-coa.org/articles/brazils-2026-presidential-candidates-lula-bolsonaro-and-other-top-contenders", "https://www.as-coa.org/articles/poll-tracker-brazils-2026-presidential-election", "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2022-09-29/bolsonaro-lula-prep-for-final-debate-before-tense-brazil-vote", "https://www.facebook.com/jovempannews/videos/elei%C3%A7%C3%B5es-2026-pesquisa-aponta-empate-t%C3%A9cnico-entre-lula-e-fl%C3%A1vio-bolsonaro/1366888702090504/", "https://www.gazetadopovo.com.br/eleicoes/2026/pesquisa-eleitoral-2026/datafolha-presidente-setembro-2026/", "https://www.jota.info/eleicoes/eleicoes-2026/lula-lidera-primeiro-turno-mas-empata-com-flavio-bolsonaro-no-segundo-aponta-palver", "https://www.malaymail.com/amp/news/world/2022/09/21/lula-widens-lead-over-bolsonaro-ahead-of-brazilian-vote-poll-shows/29307", "https://www.malaymail.com/news/world/2022/09/21/lula-widens-lead-over-bolsonaro-ahead-of-brazilian-vote-poll-shows/29307", "https://www.riotimesonline.com/atlasintel-runoff-poll-flavio-bolsonaro-edges-lula-2026", "https://www.riotimesonline.com/brazil-election-quaest-poll-flavio-42-lula-41-runoff-september-2026/", "https://www.riotimesonline.com/brazil-poll-flavio-bolsonaro-leads-lula-runoff-2026/", "https://www.statista.com/statistics/1308350", "https://www.usnews.com/news/world/articles/2026-09-07/lula-flavio-bolsonaro-tied-in-brazils-election-runoff-quaest-poll-shows", "https://www.usnews.com/news/world/articles/2026-09-17/brazils-flavio-bolsonaro-lula-tied-in-runoff-scenario-atlas-poll-shows", "https://www.usnews.com/news/world/articles/2026-09-23/brazils-lula-flavio-bolsonaro-remain-tied-in-runoff-scenario-atlas-poll-shows", "https://www.yahoo.com/news/articles/brazils-lula-flavio-bolsonaro-remain-103223304.html", "https://www.yahoo.com/news/articles/flavio-bolsonaro-draws-even-lula-161733328.html"], "meta": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "api_equivalent_usd": 0.31309, "searches": 5, "fetches": 2, "turns": 8, "latency_ms": 59619, "billing": "claude_plan"}}
{"ts": "2026-09-27T14:41:02Z", "id": "kalshi:KXRT-SENS@2026-09-27T14:41:02Z", "event": "kalshi:KXRT-SENS", "keys": ["kalshi:KXRT-SENS-70", "kalshi:KXRT-SENS-65", "kalshi:KXRT-SENS-75", "kalshi:KXRT-SENS-80"], "mids": {"kalshi:KXRT-SENS-70": 0.765, "kalshi:KXRT-SENS-65": 0.95, "kalshi:KXRT-SENS-75": 0.55, "kalshi:KXRT-SENS-80": 0.265}, "raw_facts": [{"kind": "status_now", "date": "2026-09-27", "source": "Rotten Tomatoes", "url": "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/sense_and_sensibility_2026", "fact": "On the resolution source, Sense and Sensibility (2026) has a 76% Tomatometer from 25 reviews. The Popcornmeter has 0 verified ratings. The page lists an October 16, 2026 release date."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-21", "source": "World of Reel", "url": "https://www.worldofreel.com/blog/2026/9/21/do-we-really-need-another-sense-and-sensibility-critics-say-georgia-oakleys-version-is-fine-not-essential", "fact": "On Sept 21 the film had an 80% Rotten Tomatoes score and a Metacritic score of 73. The article described the reception as mixed to positive: a competent adaptation but 'not essential'."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-16", "source": "MovieWeb", "url": "https://movieweb.com/sense-and-sensibility-2026-rotten-tomatoes-score/", "fact": "An early report after the premiere gave the film an 82% Rotten Tomatoes score from 11 reviews. It cited a 5/5 review from The Daily Telegraph. (The publication date is approximate.)"}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-22", "source": "Gold Derby / Yahoo", "url": "https://www.goldderby.com/film/2026/sense-and-sensibility-rotten-tomatoes-metacritic-review-roundup/", "fact": "A review roundup gave the film 79% on Rotten Tomatoes and 72 on Metacritic. Critics called it a 'solid undertaking' but said it lacks the charm of Ang Lee's 1995 version. Taken together, the reports show the score falling from 82% (11 reviews) to 80%, 79% and now 76% (25 reviews). (The publication date is approximate.)"}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-20", "source": "Yardbarker", "url": "https://www.yardbarker.com/entertainment/articles/daisy_edgar_jones_sense_and_sensibility_starts_strong_with_80_rotten_tomatoes_score/s1_17785_44332003", "fact": "A headline reported the film 'starts strong with 80% Rotten Tomatoes score'. (The publication date is approximate.)"}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-16", "source": "Empire / The Hollywood Reporter / TheWrap", "url": "https://www.empireonline.com/movies/reviews/sense-and-sensibility-2026/", "fact": "Reviews are split. Empire called it 'handsome but derivative', while TheWrap called it 'a delight'. Other critics faulted its 'grimy, dark, drab appearance' and said it takes itself too seriously. (The publication date is approximate.)"}, {"kind": "schedule", "date": "2026-09-27", "source": "Wikipedia / Rotten Tomatoes", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sense_and_Sensibility_(2026_film)", "fact": "The film had its world premiere in London on Sept 15, 2026. Focus Features releases it in US theaters on Oct 16, 2026, and the questions resolve on Monday, Oct 19 at 10:00 AM ET. Many more US reviews are likely to be added around release, which will change the count from its current 25."}, {"kind": "rules", "date": "2026-09-27", "source": "Kalshi market rules", "url": "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/sense_and_sensibility_2026", "fact": "The score must be strictly above each strike. A score of exactly 70, 65, 75 or 80 resolves that strike as No. At the current 76%, the Above 65, 70 and 75 strikes would be Yes and Above 80 would be No."}], "source_urls": ["https://collider.com/sense-and-sensibility-2026-rotten-tomatoes-score-is-it-good/", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Georgia_Oakley", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sense_and_Sensibility_(2026_film", "https://movieweb.com/sense-and-sensibility-2026-rotten-tomatoes-score/", "https://rtv2-production-2-6.rottentomatoes.com/m/1068832-sense_and_sensibility/reviews/?page=2&type=user", "https://tollbit.goldderby.com/film/2026/sense-and-sensibility-rotten-tomatoes-metacritic-review-roundup/", "https://www.cbr.com/sense-and-sensibility-rotten-tomatoes-score/", "https://www.empireonline.com/movies/reviews/sense-and-sensibility-2026/", "https://www.goldderby.com/film/2026/sense-and-sensibility-rotten-tomatoes-metacritic-review-roundup/", "https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-reviews/sense-and-sensibility-review-daisy-edgar-jones-jane-austen-1236706666/", "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/1068832-sense_and_sensibility", "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/1068832-sense_and_sensibility/reviews", "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/1068832-sense_and_sensibility/reviews?page=52&type=user", "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/1068832-sense_and_sensibility/reviews?type=top_critics", "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/sense_and_sensibility_2026", "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/m/sense_and_sensibility_2026/reviews", "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/tv/sense_and_sensibility/s01", "https://www.rottentomatoes.com/tv/sense_and_sensibility/s01/reviews", "https://www.thewrap.com/creative-content/movies/sense-and-sensibility-2026-review-daisy-edgar-jones/", "https://www.worldofreel.com/blog/2026/9/21/do-we-really-need-another-sense-and-sensibility-critics-say-georgia-oakleys-version-is-fine-not-essential", "https://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/movies/articles/sense-sensibility-review-director-georgia-150000297.html", "https://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/movies/articles/sense-sensibility-reviews-rt-scores-173752856.html", "https://www.yardbarker.com/entertainment/articles/daisy_edgar_jones_sense_and_sensibility_starts_strong_with_80_rotten_tomatoes_score/s1_17785_44332003"], "meta": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "api_equivalent_usd": 0.20772, "searches": 3, "fetches": 3, "turns": 7, "latency_ms": 38925, "billing": "claude_plan"}}
{"ts": "2026-09-27T14:41:02Z", "id": "polymarket:946004@2026-09-27T14:41:02Z", "event": "polymarket:946004", "keys": ["polymarket:4689727", "polymarket:4052417", "polymarket:4052418", "polymarket:4797724"], "mids": {"polymarket:4689727": 0.096, "polymarket:4052417": 0.0785, "polymarket:4052418": 0.285, "polymarket:4797724": 0.395}, "raw_facts": [{"kind": "status_now", "date": "2026-09-27", "source": "usethebitcoin.com / CoinDesk price page", "url": "https://usethebitcoin.com/bitcoin/bitcoin-price-september-27-2026/", "fact": "Bitcoin was at $84,602.39 at 2:25 am EDT on Sep 27, 2026, with 24-hour trading volume of $7.02B. It was holding near $84K as volatility tightened into quarter-end."}, {"kind": "status_now", "date": "2026-09-27", "source": "OKX / Coinbase / Bitget price pages", "url": "https://www.okx.com/en-us/price/bitcoin-btc", "fact": "On Sep 27, 2026, BTC was quoted at about $84,342 on OKX, $84,027 on Coinbase and $84,888 on Bitget. One week earlier it was about $81,299."}, {"kind": "status_now", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "24/7 Wall St.", "url": "https://247wallst.com/investing/cryptocurrency/2026/09/26/bitcoin-hit-an-eight-month-high-above-87000-on-september-21-and-is-back-under-85000-was-that-the-weeks-top-or-the-quarters/", "fact": "The September 2026 high was $87,397 on September 21, the highest since January. BTC was about $84,700 on Sep 25, and the article cites a pullback low of $82,709 after the peak. This is not Binance-specific data. A $87,397 high would be below both the $87,500 and $90,000 thresholds."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-23", "source": "Cryptonews / CoinDesk (via search summary)", "url": "https://cryptonews.com/news/bitcoin-price-prediction-september-23-2026/", "fact": "BTC reached $87,283 intraday on Sep 23 and closed at $84,378. On Sep 21 it traded above $87,000 on Coinbase and Binance, peaking at $87,397."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-24", "source": "CoinGabbar", "url": "https://www.coingabbar.com/en/bitcoin-news-today-btc-price-falls-as-us-yields-top-5-percent", "fact": "BTC fell to about $74,900\u2013$76,000 on Sep 15\u201316 after Fed action, then rallied more than 15% to a peak near $87,300 before falling back to about $83,458 on Sep 24, down 2.54% in 24 hours."}, {"kind": "rules", "date": "2026-09-27", "source": "Market rules", "url": "https://www.binance.com/en/trade/BTC_USDT", "fact": "The $80,000 and $82,500 dip questions count only price action after the market was created. If the market existed before Sep 15\u201316, the sub-$76,000 lows then would already meet both thresholds. The creation date wasn't found in this research. The $87,500 and $90,000 questions count highs from Sep 1 00:00 ET."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-07", "source": "24/7 Wall St.", "url": "https://247wallst.com/investing/cryptocurrency/2026/09/07/bitcoin-keeps-getting-rejected-at-82000-can-it-break-through-in-september-2026/", "fact": "BTC traded at $79,863 on Sep 7, 2026, after reaching $82,283 on Sep 3. It had been rejected at the low $82,000s four times since Aug 25."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-24", "source": "CoinGabbar", "url": "https://www.coingabbar.com/en/bitcoin-news-today-btc-price-falls-as-us-yields-top-5-percent", "fact": "The US 10-year Treasury yield rose above 5% on Sep 23 for the first time since 2007 and reached about 5.1%, which weighed on BTC. On Sep 21, spot bitcoin ETFs took in $999 million, their largest single day in about 11 months."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "24/7 Wall St.", "url": "https://247wallst.com/investing/cryptocurrency/2026/09/26/bitcoin-hit-an-eight-month-high-above-87000-on-september-21-and-is-back-under-85000-was-that-the-weeks-top-or-the-quarters/", "fact": "The Federal Reserve raised rates to a 3.75%\u20134% range on Sep 16. The Senate did not advance the Clarity Act on Sep 15."}, {"kind": "schedule", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "24/7 Wall St.", "url": "https://247wallst.com/investing/cryptocurrency/2026/09/26/bitcoin-hit-an-eight-month-high-above-87000-on-september-21-and-is-back-under-85000-was-that-the-weeks-top-or-the-quarters/", "fact": "Quarter-end rebalancing falls on Sep 30. The questions close at 11:59 PM ET on Sep 30, about 3.5 days after Sep 27. From about $84,500, BTC would need to rise about 3.5% to reach $87,500 or 6.5% to reach $90,000, or fall about 2.4% to reach $82,500 or 5.3% to reach $80,000."}], "source_urls": ["https://247wallst.com/investing/cryptocurrency/2026/09/07/bitcoin-keeps-getting-rejected-at-82000-can-it-break-through-in-september-2026/", "https://247wallst.com/investing/cryptocurrency/2026/09/26/bitcoin-hit-an-eight-month-high-above-87000-on-september-21-and-is-back-under-85000-was-that-the-weeks-top-or-the-quarters/", "https://coindcx.com/blog/price-predictions/bitcoin-price-weekly/", "https://coinmarketcap.com/academy/article/bitcoin-price-pulls-back-87k-altcoins-rally", "https://coinpaper.com/35981/bitcoin-price-prediction-how-high-can-it-go-in-2026", "https://cryptonews.com/news/bitcoin-price-prediction-september-23-2026/", "https://decrypt.co/prediction-markets/btc-price-above-84-000-on-september-26-2026-at-11-59pm-utc", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cryptocurrency_bubble", "https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/crypto/articles/bitcoin-hit-eight-month-high-110008952.html", "https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/crypto/articles/bitcoin-keeps-getting-rejected-82-133750435.html", "https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/crypto/articles/why-bitcoin-today-closed-above-125755691.html", "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BTC-USD/history/", "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BTC=F/history/", "https://fortune.com/article/price-of-bitcoin-09-03-2026/", "https://goldprice.org/cryptocurrency-price/bitcoin-price", "https://news.bitcoin.com/crypto-news/bitcoin-price-80k-fomc-cpi-jobless-claims-september-2026/", "https://robinhood.com/us/en/prediction-markets/crypto/events/btc-15-min-84-58814-target-sep-27-2026/", "https://robinhood.com/us/en/prediction-markets/crypto/events/btc-15-min-84-91949-target-sep-27-2026/", "https://robinhood.com/us/en/prediction-markets/crypto/events/btc-15-min-84-92340-target-sep-27-2026/", "https://robinhood.com/us/en/prediction-markets/crypto/events/btc-price-on-sep-26-2026-at-11am-edt-sep-26-2026/", "https://robinhood.com/us/en/prediction-markets/crypto/events/btc-price-on-sep-26-2026-at-1am-edt-sep-26-2026/", "https://robinhood.com/us/en/prediction-markets/crypto/events/btc-price-on-sep-26-2026-at-1pm-edt-sep-26-2026/", "https://robinhood.com/us/en/prediction-markets/crypto/events/btc-price-on-sep-26-2026-at-2am-edt-sep-26-2026/", "https://robinhood.com/us/en/prediction-markets/crypto/events/btc-price-on-sep-26-2026-at-4am-edt-sep-26-2026/", "https://robinhood.com/us/en/prediction-markets/crypto/events/btc-price-on-sep-26-2026-at-5am-edt-sep-26-2026/", "https://robinhood.com/us/en/prediction-markets/crypto/events/btc-price-on-sep-26-2026-at-8pm-edt-sep-26-2026/", "https://robinhood.com/us/en/prediction-markets/crypto/events/btc-price-on-sep-27-2026-at-10am-edt-sep-27-2026/", "https://robinhood.com/us/en/prediction-markets/crypto/events/btc-price-on-sep-27-2026-at-11am-edt-sep-26-2026/", "https://robinhood.com/us/en/prediction-markets/crypto/events/btc-price-on-sep-27-2026-at-7am-edt-sep-27-2026/", "https://robinhood.com/us/en/prediction-markets/crypto/events/btc-price-on-sep-7-2026-at-1pm-edt-sep-07-2026/", "https://robinhood.com/us/en/prediction-markets/crypto/events/btc-price-range-on-sep-26-2026-at-11pm-edt-sep-25-2026/", "https://robinhood.com/us/en/prediction-markets/crypto/events/btc-price-range-on-sep-27-2026-at-11am-edt-sep-26-2026/", "https://tw.tradingview.com/chart/BTCUSD/5QLtCbcE-BTC-USDT-1DAY-UPDATE-BY-CRYPTOSANDERS", "https://usethebitcoin.com/bitcoin/bitcoin-price-september-27-2026/", "https://www.bitget.com/price/bitcoin", "https://www.coinbase.com/price/bitcoin", "https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/09/21/live-updates-bitcoin-rises-above-usd82-000-as-falling-oil-lifts-risk-assets", "https://www.coindesk.com/daybook-us/2026/04/29/bitcoin-trading-volume-is-falling-fast-that-rarely-ends-smoothly", "https://www.coindesk.com/price/bitcoin", "https://www.coingabbar.com/en/bitcoin-news-today-btc-price-falls-as-us-yields-top-5-percent", "https://www.coinreporter.io/2026/09/bitcoin-pulls-back-below-85000-after-hitting-multi-month-highs-near-87000/", "https://www.cryptotimes.io/2026/09/04/bitcoin-price-prediction-september-2026-can-btc-reach-90k-or-retest-72k/", "https://www.oddsshopper.com/articles/prediction-markets/bitcoin-monthly-high-odds-model-verdict", "https://www.okx.com/en-us/orbit/insight/88166193574400", "https://www.okx.com/en-us/price/bitcoin-btc"], "meta": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "api_equivalent_usd": 0.27695, "searches": 5, "fetches": 2, "turns": 8, "latency_ms": 47944, "billing": "claude_plan"}}
{"ts": "2026-09-27T14:41:02Z", "id": "polymarket:1089266@2026-09-27T14:41:02Z", "event": "polymarket:1089266", "keys": ["polymarket:5009020", "polymarket:5009022"], "mids": {"polymarket:5009020": 0.39, "polymarket:5009022": 0.0725}, "raw_facts": [{"kind": "status_now", "date": "2026-09-27", "source": "Bitcoin.com News", "url": "https://news.bitcoin.com/market-updates/bitcoin-price-climbs-back-toward-85k-with-bulls-in-the-drivers-seat/", "fact": "Bitcoin was at $84,899 at 8 a.m. on Sept. 27, 2026, up 0.9% in 24 hours (article published 9:40 AM EDT). That is about $900 (1.1%) above the $84,000 threshold and about $1,900 (2.2%) above $83,000. The article did not give the intraday low for Sept. 27."}, {"kind": "status_now", "date": "2026-09-27", "source": "CoinDesk", "url": "https://www.coindesk.com/price/bitcoin", "fact": "CoinDesk's price page showed BTC at $84,758.42, up 0.90% (+$752.19) over 24 hours, with a market cap of $1.70 trillion. The page did not list a 24-hour high or low."}, {"kind": "status_now", "date": "2026-09-27", "source": "CoinDesk (via search result)", "url": "https://www.coindesk.com/price/bitcoin", "fact": "BTC was $84,602.39 at 2:25 am EDT on Sept. 27, 2026, with $7.02B in 24-hour volume. This means that in the early ET hours of the resolution day, the price was only about $600 above $84,000."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "CryptoPotato", "url": "https://cryptopotato.com/qnt-leads-altcoin-rally-btc-price-aims-at-85k-again-weekend-watch/", "fact": "After being rejected at a lower high near $85,000, bitcoin dipped to $83,000 again on Friday (Sept. 25), then rebounded to $84,000 and held there on Saturday. By the weekend it sat just below $85,000."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-27", "source": "Bitcoin.com News", "url": "https://news.bitcoin.com/market-updates/bitcoin-price-climbs-back-toward-85k-with-bulls-in-the-drivers-seat/", "fact": "BTC fell from its September high of $87,374 (reached between Sept. 18 and Sept. 22) into the low $83,000s before recovering. Listed support levels are $84,000, $83,300, $80,106 and $74,913. The latest rise came on much lighter volume than trading on Sept. 21\u201323."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-26", "source": "KuCoin / Analytics Insight (search summaries)", "url": "https://www.kucoin.com/news/flash/bitcoin-falls-to-84-000-as-altcoins-surge-privacy-coins-outperform", "fact": "Earlier in the week, BTC fell from $87,359 to a low of $83,654 within 24 hours, a 3.80% drop, and was down 8.32% over seven days. The move was linked to the US 10-year Treasury yield rising above 5% (to 5.11%) for the first time since 2007. About $80M in long positions were liquidated near $84,000, and traders were watching $82,800 as the next support."}, {"kind": "event", "date": "2026-09-27", "source": "UseTheBitcoin", "url": "https://usethebitcoin.com/bitcoin/bitcoin-price-september-27-2026/", "fact": "BTC was holding near $84,000, about 4% below a weekly high of about $87,363. The article puts immediate support at $83,800\u2013$84,000 and secondary support at $81,400 (the 20-day EMA). Bollinger Bands were compressed around the price, and the daily RSI was 64.06."}, {"kind": "base_rate", "date": "2026-09-27", "source": "UseTheBitcoin", "url": "https://usethebitcoin.com/bitcoin/bitcoin-price-september-27-2026/", "fact": "BTC rose about 43.5% in Q3 2026, from about $58,500 in early July, which would be its second-best Q3 on record after 2017 (+80.4%). In the past week, daily swings between high and low reached about 3.8% (roughly $3,700)."}, {"kind": "schedule", "date": "2026-09-27", "source": "Polymarket rules (question text)", "url": "https://www.binance.com/en/trade/BTC_USDT", "fact": "The window is Sept. 27, 12:00 AM to 11:59 PM ET (closing 04:00 UTC Sept. 28). Sept. 27 is a Sunday, so no US macro data releases are due. A single Binance BTC/USDT 1-minute candle with a low at or below the threshold is enough for YES, and the market resolves immediately when that 